{"type":"META","ticket":317,"id":"META"}||{"title":"Generic_Touch_6CH_GND_Logical","tags":[],"source":"","images":[],"attributes":{"Symbol":"2a01ece521c539d6","Footprint":"","Description":"TOUCH_6CH_GND_LOGICAL","Name":"Generic_Touch_6CH_GND_Logical","Designator":"J?","Value":"TOUCH_6CH_GND_LOGICAL","Footprint_Candidate_Status":"pending_not_selected","Design_Notes":"Seven-pin logical interface only: 1..6=ELE0..ELE5; 7=GND reference. Physical connector, pitch, mating orientation, shield termination and exact physical numbering remain TBD. Not compatible with previous 12-pin logical order. No physical connector footprint or catalog MPN assigned.","ReviewStatus":"new_logical_pin_order_connector_tbd","Comment":"Touch 6CH + GND logical interface","Catalog_Status":"TBD","Selection_Blocker":"TBD: pitch, mating part, polarization/keying, mounting/orientation, contact-current rating and exact physical pin numbering.","Catalog_Notes":"Seven-pin logical interface only: 1..6=ELE0..ELE5; 7=GND reference. Physical connector, pitch, mating orientation, shield termination and exact physical numbering remain TBD. Not compatible with previous 12-pin logical order. No physical connector footprint or catalog MPN assigned.","Candidate_Disclaimer":"工程候选：未完成硬件测试、PCB/钢网复核与采购放行。","Add into BOM":"yes"}}|
